This project uses and derives layout geometry from the OpenSUSI TR-1um open PDK
(https://github.com/OpenSUSI/TR-1um), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The PDK includes the IP62 process data, Copyright 2025 TOKAI RIKA CO., LTD,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Cell layouts in cells/ are generated
with the PDK's parameterized cells; no PDK files are redistributed in this repository.
The PDK is fetched at a pinned commit (notebook/setup_pins.json) at run time.

The ternary cell circuits and device sizes come from the author's taped-out design
opensusi-tr10-balanced-ternary-logic
(https://github.com/PenguinEino/opensusi-tr10-balanced-ternary-logic), released here
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
